    GlobalTheory.HoweGlobal.relInf Bs G om ≤ LinearMap.ker (R.p ∘ₗ (G.M.Pol Bs.ψ Bs.emb).subtype) ∧
    ∀ g ∈ GlobalTheory.HoweGlobal.opInf Bs G om, ∀ x ∈ LinearMap.ker (R.p ∘ₗ (G.M.Pol Bs.ψ Bs.emb).subtype),
